# =====================================================================================
# Force-included exceptions. These are LOAD-BEARING, not leftovers:
#   ica/*.npy, ica/*.json    the frozen reduction mapping — reducer.py does
#                            np.load("ica/...") at import time and cannot start without it
#   tests/reducer_reference.npz  the committed regression oracle for reducer_test.py
# Do not "clean up" these negations.
!ica/*.npy
!ica/*.json
!tests/reducer_reference.npz
